                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Congratulations to the student dev team.\nI love puzzle games, with new ideas and this game is brilliant !\nSadly after 3 maps you're through and get back to the main menu, so I would call it more a demo than a game. But it is free, so that's okay.\nEven if it is very short - 10-15 minutes playtime - it is unique and has a great flow.\nIf you devs ever think of making a full length title out of this demo, be shure that I will buy it !\nThanks for one of the most entertaining 15 minutes in my life. :)",
